# The audio tests in a page: haxe build-web.hxml -> web/app.js, beside web/index.html; serve web/ and open it in a browser that lets audio
# start without a gesture (Chromium's --autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required). window.helixResult holds {passed, checks, failures}
# when they're done. helix-platform alone: haxelib dev helix-platform <checkout>/platform first.
-lib helix-platform
-cp .
-main AudioTests
-dce full
-js web/app.js
